Appleseed patch series
======================

Upstream: https://github.com/appleseedhq/appleseed
Base: c4ba82893febd711befb194f905e955d3ee143a3
The numbered bootstrap patches adapt Appleseed to the bundled
dependencies and native toolchains. The Boost group uses the C++17
standard library and PCRE2 for the core renderer and command-line tools.
Series.cmake applies both groups in order. The optional Python bindings
still require Boost.Python.

Review topics
-------------

01. bootstrap: Dependency modules
02. bootstrap: Native build targets
03. bootstrap: Library api compatibility
04. bootstrap: Shader api compatibility
05. bootstrap: Support files
06. bootstrap: Support bundled libraries and platform toolchains
07. bootstrap: Harden core helpers and export image conversion
08. boost: Use standard optional caches and drop unused Wave
09. boost: Use standard containers for the LRU cache index
10. boost: Use a read-only standard shader surface-area index
11. boost: Use C++17 filesystem and native file timestamps
12. boost: Use native atomics and standard renderer counters
13. boost: Use standard locks, threads and condition variables
14. boost: Use chrono timestamps and remove DateTime adapters
15. boost: Remove Bind and synchronize denoiser workers
16. boost: Use standard helpers and PCRE2 without core Boost
17. boost: Stage complete shader resources and executable tools
